Honestly, the graphic photos are exactly the sort of heavy-handed nagging I can't stand, and they'd make me want to pick the thing I actually fancy out of stubbornness, but I'd rather not eat my snack while looking at a bowel tumour, so I'll take the KIND nut bar, which has no warning and is something I'd enjoy anyway.

Strictly, the KIND bar is high in calories too, but it isn't labelled as a warning item, so it's the decent middle ground between something satisfying and not being lectured at.

